    lords:'BPHS 6.29 to 6.30: the parts have the lords Vishnu, Chandra, Marichi, Tvashta, Dhata, Shiva, Ravi, Yama, Yaksha, Gandharva, Kala and Varuna, repeating. Odd signs count from Aries and even signs from Libra.',
    how:'Each sign is cut into 40 parts of 0.75 degrees. Odd signs start from Aries, even signs start from Libra; the parts go on one sign at a time.',
    lagna:'Rising sign of D40. House 4 (mother\'s line), 9 (luck), 1 (the self), 5 (merit).',
    focus:[4,9,1,5], kar:['Moon','Jupiter'],
    houses:['Your own auspicious or hard effects at the core.','The family\'s fortune; maternal wealth.','Efforts that bring fortune or loss.','The mother\'s line, home luck, inherited peace; a main house of D40.','Merit, intelligence, past good deeds; a main house of D40.','Hard effects: illness, debt, inherited quarrels.','Effects through partners.','Inherited hard effects, hidden matters.','Luck and blessings; the second main house of D40.','Effects in career and status.','Gains from the family\'s fortune.','Loss of inherited fortune, spending.'],
    planets:{Sun:'Father\'s side; authority; vitality of the line.',Moon:'The main significator of the mother\'s line; the heart of D40.',Mars:'Energy of the line; quarrels or courage.',Mercury:'Skills and business sense in the line.',Jupiter:'Blessings of the family; protection.',Venus:'Comfort and love in the line.',Saturn:'Burdens and duties of the line.',Rahu:'Unusual, foreign or unclear inheritances.',Ketu:'Spiritual line or past-life ties.'},
