    rules:[[C,'D40 is for auspicious and inauspicious effects (BPHS list of sixteen divisions).'],[P,'Many teachers read it for the mother\'s side; benefics strong show inherited good, hard planets strong show inherited trouble.'],[P,'The lagna lord and the Moon both strong in D40: an auspicious base.'],[P,'The 4th and 9th lords linked: blessings come through the family.']],
