    planets:{Sun:'Self-respect, father\'s line, honour.',Moon:'Emotional character, mother\'s teaching.',Mars:'Courage, temper, discipline.',Mercury:'Honesty in speech, cleverness.',Jupiter:'Ethics, wisdom, goodwill.',Venus:'Charm, indulgence, refinement.',Saturn:'Discipline, restraint, sternness.',Rahu:'Ambition, deception, rule-breaking.',Ketu:'Detachment, simplicity, aloofness.'},
    steps:['Check the lagna lord and the 1st, 9th and 10th houses in D45.','Check the Sun (father) and benefic planets.','Compare with D12 and D1.','Read benefic strength as a clean line and hard planets strong as a rough one.'],
    rules:[[C,'D45 is for general indications: character and conduct (BPHS list of sixteen divisions).'],[P,'Many teachers read it for the father\'s side; benefics strong show a clean line, hard planets strong show a rough one.'],[P,'The lagna lord strong in D45: conduct is steady and honourable; weak: struggles with habits.'],[P,'Moral weaknesses show as hard planets on the lagna lord or the Moon; as always, read them as work to do.']],
    combos:['Jupiter and the Sun strong in D45: honour, ethics.','Rahu on the lagna lord: ambition that tests ethics.'],
