    focus:[4,9,1], kar:['Sun','Moon'],
    steps:['Read D12 first.','Use D144 only to confirm: are the same planets strong?','Note planets that repeat their sign in D12 and D144.'],
    rules:[[P,'Used by some schools; not one of Parashara\'s sixteen; definitions differ.'],[P,'Use it to confirm the strong and weak planets of D12, not to start a new story.']],
    combos:['The Sun and Moon strong in D12 and D144: a supportive line confirmed at a fine level.'],
